      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the LLM Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Generative AI as the external LLM provider. This choice is now a concrete component of the planned Python file, and will be incorporated into the code. The Python file will be named summarize\\_text.py.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI've outlined the core implementation steps for `summarize_text.py`. The plan is to import the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library, initialize a `TextGenerationModel` (likely `text-bison@002`), and define a function. This function will take text, construct a summarization prompt, call the model's `predict` method, and return the summary.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820536453,
          "start": 1789820534719
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b99dffbf001ROw5bqN4wFgq4x",
      "message_id": "msg_0b99dfa490017jn2M8hZLCgvbp",
      "session_id": "ses_f4662063dffeP3Ownr2jTe1V51",
      "time_created": 1789820534719,
      "time_updated": 1789820536454
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "N8r0xRlTmZcYiU3P",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import aiplatform\n\ndef summarize_text(text: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calls a hosted LLM (Google's Vertex AI) to summarize long text.\n    \"\"\"\n    aiplatform.init(project=\"YOUR_PROJECT_ID\", location=\"YOUR_REGION\") # Replace with your GCP project ID and region\n    \n    model = aiplatform.PredictionServiceClient()\n    \n    # Using the TextGenerationModel from Vertex AI for summarization\n    model = aiplatform.TextGenerationModel.from_pretrained(\"text-bison@002\")\n\n    prompt = f\"\"\"Summarize the following text:\n\n{text}\n\nSummary:\"\"\"\n\n    response = model.predict(prompt=prompt)\n    return response.text.strip()\n",
            "filePath": "summarize_text.py"
          },
